WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.173
Watch this bass disappear.

00:00:01.173 --> 00:00:02.347
Right behind that tree.

00:00:02.347 --> 00:00:04.400
Keep your eyes on the little lure.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.281
It flicks left.

00:00:05.281 --> 00:00:06.161
He slides closer.

00:00:06.161 --> 00:00:06.748
Another twitch.

00:00:06.748 --> 00:00:08.508
Now he is right behind it.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.388
Wait for it.

00:00:09.388 --> 00:00:10.562
That tail is loaded.

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:12.616
One tiny twitch, and here he comes.

00:00:12.616 --> 00:00:12.909
Boom!

00:00:12.909 --> 00:00:14.083
The line goes tight.

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:15.549
That was worth the wait.
